post-tool-use.mjs is the generated bundle of post-tool-use.ts, rebuilt by the claude-code-hooks build script (`claude-code-hooks -i 'src/*.ts' -o hooks.json`, which also regenerates the bundle). The TypeScript source is the only hand-edited side, so a source edit without a rebuild silently ships the stale bundle to every wiki check run, and a hand-edit of the bundle is overwritten by the next build.
